## Implementation Summary
{step:implement}

Design regression test cases for this bugfix. Extract test points from the root cause, the fix, and adjacent risk areas. At minimum include a case that reproduces the original bug (red before fix, green after) and cases for boundary/exception paths touched by the fix. Output the Universal Case Matrix (knowledge §3) and Table-Driven Case Spec (knowledge §5.1) where applicable. Prioritize P0/P1 cases and keep output under 80 lines.

